WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:09.900
Last time on True Fear, I talked about how
I pretty much almost died on the subway.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.910
If you haven’t seen that one, I will take
pity on you, and leave you a link so you can

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:15.660
go check that out.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.640
And as I mentioned in the last one, I live
in LA now but I’m a Chicago guy and I love

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:21.640
my Cubs.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:25.599
For those of you who don’t know, Harry Caray
was one of the most legendary Cubs TV broadcasters

00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:29.960
in the 80s and 90s to the point where he’s
become an icon, in fact the stadium now has

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.710
video boards upon which they frequently have
Harry lead the 7th inning stretch at Wrigley.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:38.300
For some reason, pretty much all Chicago sports
legends have their own steakhouse.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:43.350
You’ve got Walter Payton’s Roundhouse,
Ditka’s Restaurant, Michael Jordan’s Steakhouse

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:49.079
and of course, Harry Caray’s Italian Steakhouse,
which is where today’s story begins.

00:00:49.079 --> 00:00:51.870
Shall we dig right in?

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.149
Sorry for that pun.

00:00:53.149 --> 00:00:56.100
So the year was 2012 and I had just graduated
from High School.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:00.190
It was August, so that summer was winding
down, and some of us were on the way to college

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:04.250
in the next couple of weeks, so we wanted
to get together for one last dinner, and we

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:07.820
had never really been anywhere nice before
so we thought it would be cool to hit up the

00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:09.610
legendary Harry Caray’s.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.470
At the front of the restaurant, there is this
bust of the man himself and on the wall you

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:17.110
see all the pictures of celebrities who have
been to the restaurant posing with the bust.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.430
We decide to get a group photo around it.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:20.430
So that was it.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.660
We take the photo, get out of there, and go
home.

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.230
… OK, but there’s more.

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:27.250
At some point the photo gets uploaded onto
Facebook, right?

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:31.630
Eight days later, one of the guys… we’ll
just call him Sheik, leaves the following

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:32.630
comment:

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:35.710
“hey Roman, is that your hand on my left
shoulder?

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:37.880
cuz it looks like translucent”

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:38.950
To which he replied:

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:42.430
“I honestly don't know if that's my hand
haha”

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.390
Sheik replies: “doesnt it look alittle strange
tho?

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:47.010
its like transparent”

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:49.080
Then I notice an interesting detail.

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:51.800
“There's a ring on it... it isn't any of
us…”

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:55.100
We’re all 18 at this point and none of us
are married.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:58.860
Plus just look at us, clearly none of us are
married, OK I’m done.

00:01:58.860 --> 00:01:59.860
Done.

00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:04.250
Then Roman brings up that it could be like
a class ring but his hand is straight down

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.290
by his side.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:09.479
And you can clearly tell by the angle of where
he is that you would see his wrist if it was

00:02:09.479 --> 00:02:10.479
him.

00:02:10.479 --> 00:02:14.870
The next comment reads: “If I had to guess,
it kind of looks like Mr. Boathouse’s...

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:17.980
Or the floating hand from the Adam's family”.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:22.879
Well, first of all dude, it’s called The
Adams Family, not Adam’s Family.

00:02:22.879 --> 00:02:26.409
Second of all, the possibility of it being
Mr. Boathouse’s hand is probably the most

00:02:26.409 --> 00:02:31.659
likely explanation at this point, but I honestly
don’t believe that it’s him based on distance

00:02:31.659 --> 00:02:33.209
and the angle of his hand.

00:02:33.209 --> 00:02:37.849
Even if he was able to reach that far, his
hand would be more pointed to the left hand

00:02:37.849 --> 00:02:38.900
side of the photo.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:41.630
Plus, something comes up later to prove that
it wasn’t him.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:42.909
I’ll get back to that.

00:02:42.909 --> 00:02:47.919
This guy thinks that it’s Bailor’s hand,
but that doesn’t make sense, so I say, “Bailor’s

00:02:47.919 --> 00:02:51.280
hands are on Roman's left shoulder and Mr
Boathouse’'s right shoulder.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.370
It can't be Bailor.”

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:56.190
So his next suggestion just reiterates the
possibility that it’s Mr. Boathouse’s

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.190
hand.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:59.980
That’s when Sheik reveals how he first noticed
the mysterious hand.

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:05.200
He writes this: “its not, hes the one who
noticed and questioned the hand on my shoulder”

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.959
So basically that’s not any of our hands.

00:03:07.959 --> 00:03:12.930
My hands both seem to be in my pockets, and
besides, it’s only my left hand that is

00:03:12.930 --> 00:03:13.930
concealed.

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.049
That’s a right hand on Sheik’s shoulder.

00:03:15.049 --> 00:03:16.049
ADDITIONAL “EVIDENCE”

00:03:16.049 --> 00:03:19.489
So I came up with the theory that the ghost
of Harry Caray wanted to get in on our photo.

00:03:19.489 --> 00:03:22.519
This was 2012 it was the worst Cubs season
in over 40 years.

00:03:22.519 --> 00:03:26.170
They lost over 100 games that year, so it
makes sense that Harry’s ghost would be

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:27.189
especially restless.

00:03:27.189 --> 00:03:31.780
It’s also been said that in Game 7 of the
World Series in 2016, when the Cubs gave up

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:36.219
the lead and lost their momentum going into
extra innings, that the spirits of Harry Caray,

00:03:36.219 --> 00:03:40.550
Ernie Banks and Ron Santo came together to
cause the rain delay that gave the team time

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:44.499
to recuperate and come out swinging with everything
on the line in the 10th.

00:03:44.499 --> 00:03:47.810
If you found this story entertaining, and
you’d be willing to go ahead and drop me

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.579
a like on this video, that would be much appreciated.

00:03:50.579 --> 00:03:53.769
Be sure to leave your own theory, down in
the comments.

00:03:53.769 --> 00:03:58.120
For the next True Fear, I’ll probably do
that follow up video on The Hobo King.

00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:59.870
Let me know if you guys still want to see
that.

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:03.249
I’ve been talking to some different people
who have their own stories about creepy stuff

00:04:03.249 --> 00:04:07.020
going down in that apartment complex and they
said that they’d be willing to come on the

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:12.200
show and talk about it so be sure to subscribe
to CZsWorld for new horrors every week,

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.739
ring that death-bell for notifications.

00:04:13.739 --> 00:04:14.749
Aaand yeah.

00:04:14.749 --> 00:04:16.160
I’ll see you in the next one.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.380
Assuming, we both survive.

